{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\FolderWatch\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-tools-in-root",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "vimeo/psalm, phpunit/phpunit are in require-dev of composer.json. The manual recommends a vendor-bin/ of bamarni/composer-bin-plugin per tool, so that the dependencies of a tool cannot conflict with those of the app."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocp-deprecated",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Alert/MailChannel.php:51 OCP\\Mail\\IMailer::validateMailAddress(): deprecated since Nextcloud 32; use IEmailValidator::isValid() instead",
        "lib/Service/UserSettings.php:28 OCP\\IConfig::getUserValue(): deprecated since Nextcloud 33; use IUserConfig directly",
        "lib/Service/UserSettings.php:32 OCP\\IConfig::setUserValue(): deprecated since Nextcloud 33; use IUserConfig directly"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "3 uses in 2 files of the public API that is deprecated in Nextcloud 33 to 36. The text of the tag names the replacement where it has one.",
        "  lib/Alert/MailChannel.php:51 OCP\\Mail\\IMailer::validateMailAddress(): deprecated since Nextcloud 32; use IEmailValidator::isValid() instead",
        "  lib/Service/UserSettings.php:28 OCP\\IConfig::getUserValue(): deprecated since Nextcloud 33; use IUserConfig directly",
        "  lib/Service/UserSettings.php:32 OCP\\IConfig::setUserValue(): deprecated since Nextcloud 33; use IUserConfig directly"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "transaction-manual",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Db/QueueItemMapper.php:36"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 transaction is opened and closed by hand. The trait TTransactional has atomic() since Nextcloud 24 and atomicRetry() since Nextcloud 27, which repeats a transaction that ran into a deadlock, as the manual recommends.",
        "  lib/Db/QueueItemMapper.php:36"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "time-direct",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Alert/NotificationChannel.php:27 new DateTime()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "lib/ reads the clock directly in 1 place. OCP\\AppFramework\\Utility\\ITimeFactory, a PSR-20 ClockInterface, gives the same time and can be replaced in a test.",
        "  lib/Alert/NotificationChannel.php:27 new DateTime()"
      ]
    },
